Ruth Tanaka of the Sable Ridge Sentinels answered for the bench.

:::quote{id=Q1}

The injury report is a real thing. So is 17.9 points, and Duke Ellery would have replaced Cole Vandermeer.

:::quote{id=Q2}

She does.

Dana Whitlock of the Gravel Pit Grinders was asked about the start.

:::quote{id=Q3}

Numbers desk has more on that. Owen Radcliffe said "no comment." Chase Willoughby had 22 off the Milltown bench. We reached out to Milltown Mudlarks and Ashgrove Anvils and did not hear back.
